{"speciesId":347,"names":{"fr":"Anorith","es":"Anorith","en":"Anorith","ja":"アノプス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"ANORITH was regenerated from a prehistoric fossil. This primitive POKéMON once lived in warm seas. It grips its prey firmly between its two large claws."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"ANORITH is said to be a type of POKéMON predecessor, with eight wings at the sides of its body. This POKéMON swam in the primordial sea by undulating these eight wings."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It was resurrected from a fossil using the power of science. It swims by undulating the eight wings at its sides. They were feet that adapted to life in the sea."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is a kind of POKéMON progenitor. It uses its extending claws to catch prey hiding among rocks on the seafloor."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is a kind of POKéMON progenitor. It uses its extending claws to catch prey hiding among rocks on the seafloor."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"An ancestral Pokémon that lived in the ocean. Over time, its eight feet transformed into wings."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"An ancestral Pokémon that lived in the ocean. Over time, its eight feet transformed into wings."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un ancêtre Pokémon réanimé à partir d’un fossile. Il vivait en mer et chassait avec ses pinces."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un ancêtre Pokémon réanimé à partir d’un fossile. Il vivait en mer et chassait avec ses pinces."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"C’est un Pokémon préhistorique. Caché derrière les rochers, il utilise ses pinces extensibles pour attraper ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Es una especie de Pokémon predecesor. Estira las pinzas para cazar a sus presas, que se esconden en las rocas del mar."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It is a kind of Pokémon progenitor. It uses its extending claws to catch prey hiding among rocks on the seafloor."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ポケモンの 先祖の 一種。 海底の 岩場に 隠れた 獲物を 伸びる ツノで 捕らえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Un ancêtre Pokémon réanimé à partir d’un fossile. Il vivait en mer et chassait avec ses pinces."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Este Pokémon fue recreado a partir de restos fósiles. Vivía en el mar y cazaba con sus pinzas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"化石から 復活した ポケモンの 先祖の 一種。海で 暮らし ツメで 獲物を 捕まえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Anorith fut ressuscité à partir d’un fossile préhistorique. Ce Pokémon primitif vivait à l’époque dans les eaux tropicales. Il attrape fermement sa proie avec ses deux grandes pinces."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Anorith se regeneró a partir de un fósil prehistórico. Este Pokémon primitivo vivía en mares cálidos. Gracias a sus enormes pinzas puede agarrar a su presa con firmeza."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Anorith was regenerated from a prehistoric fossil. This primitive Pokémon once lived in warm seas. It grips its prey firmly between its two large claws."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"太古の 化石から 蘇った ポケモン。 暖かい 海に 生息し 発達した ２本の ツメで 獲物を がっちり つかむ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On raconte qu’Anorith est l’un des ancêtres des Pokémon. Il nageait dans la mer originelle en faisant onduler les huit ailes placées sur les côtés de son corps."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"De Anorith dicen que es una especie de Pokémon predecesor. Tiene ocho alas a ambos lados del cuerpo. Gracias a ellas, pudo nadar por las primeras aguas que hubo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Anorith is said to be a type of Pokémon predecessor, with eight wings at the sides of its body. This Pokémon swam in the primordial sea by undulating these eight wings."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ポケモンの 先祖の 一種と いわれている。 体の 横に ついた ８枚の 羽を くねらせて 太古の 海を 泳いでいた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ce Pokémon ranimé à partir d’un fossile vivait dans des eaux très pures. Il ne pourrait donc pas s’acclimater aux océans actuels."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Si este Pokémon, regenerado a partir de un fósil, se libera en el mar, no se aclimata bien debido a la notable diferencia en la calidad del agua."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"When restored Anorith are released into the ocean, they don’t thrive, because the water composition has changed since their era."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"化石から 復元した アノプスを 海に 放っても 元気が ない。 当時と 水質が 違うからだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ce Pokémon Insecte préhistorique nageait apparemment à une vitesse surprenante grâce à ses huit « ailes »."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Un Pokémon insecto ancestral. Según parece, era capaz de nadar sorprendentemente rápido gracias a sus ocho alas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"This is one kind of primeval bug Pokémon. With eight wings, it could apparently swim a lot faster than you’d expect."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"古代の むしポケモンの １種。 ８枚の ハネを 使って 意外に 素早く 泳いでいた らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Restauré à partir d’un fossile, ce Pokémon vivait dans l’océan il y a environ 100 millions d’années et chassait ses proies avec ses deux pinces."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Este Pokémon se regeneró a partir de un fósil. Habitaba en los mares de hace cien millones de años. Atrapaba a sus presas con sus dos pinzas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon was restored from a fossil. Anorith lived in the ocean about 100,000,000 years ago, hunting with its pair of claws."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"化石から 復元した ポケモン。 １億年ほど前の 海で 暮らし ２本の ツメで 狩りをしていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon peut nager très vite en agitant ses huit ailes comme des rames de bateau. Il fait partie des ancêtres des Pokémon Insecte."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Puede nadar rápidamente gracias a sus ocho alas que usa a modo de remo. Es uno de los antepasados de los Pokémon insecto."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Anorith can swim swiftly by pulling its eight wings through the water like oars on a boat. This Pokémon is an ancestor of modern bug Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"８枚の ハネを ボートの オールの ように 動かし 速く 泳げる。 虫ポケモンの 祖先の 一種。"}],"varieties":[{"id":347,"moves":[{"name":"scratch","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-